# Shell scripts, YAML, properties and Docker configs must keep LF: a CRLF in `infra/trino/etc`
# is read by a Linux JVM, and a CRLF in azure-pipelines.yml is a YAML parsing surprise waiting to
# happen. Everything else is normalised the same way so the repository has one line ending.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.parquet binary
